     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I currently have a working app that uses Leaflet and has an absolutePanel with controls for toggling different map layers. I started this project by cannibalizing from Joe Cheng&#39;s amazing SuperZip app.</div><div><br></div><div>I have a problem born out of wanting to show a rendered DataTable on a certain map view. The table successfully shows and hides based on user inputs, but it permanently impacts the size of the absolutePanel. In other words, when I first start my App - my panel is the perfect, slim size. When I select the requisite buttons to display the table, the panel widens to accomodate it. When I de-select those items, the table goes away, but the panel remains the same widened size.</div><div><br></div><div>Anyone have any advice for how to best handle this situation?</div><div><br></div><div>One solution I have played around with is simply displaying a SECOND absolutePanel dedicated to displaying this table, and nesting a conditionalPanel inside of it. However, I run into the same issue. When the data is displayed, it successfully appears in a large box over my map. When the table goes away, the large box remains and obstructs the view.</div><div><br></div><div>I suspect there is another method of tackling this situation that I&#39;m not seeing. I don&#39;t have much CSS experience, and I&#39;m using what the SuperZip explorer came with.</div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s a snippet of the code I am usingthat renders a datatable that permanently increases the panel&#39;s size.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">absolutePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;controls&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;panel panel-default&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        draggable </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> top </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">60</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bottom </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> height </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>        h2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Lives Explorer&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>        radioButtons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;view&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;View:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> views</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Map Only&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        hr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        <br><br><br>        conditionalPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;input.view==&#39;Lives&#39;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          radioButtons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;lob&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;LoB:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lob_vars</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ma&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          checkboxGroupInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;strat&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Stratification:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> strats</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Traditional&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          radioButtons</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;thresh&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Follow-up year Threshold:&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thresholds</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;None&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;matrix&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          hr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ppv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s my attempt at a second panel, which obstructively lingers when the table is displayed, then hidden.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">      absolutePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;controls&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">class</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;panel panel-default&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">fixed</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                    draggable </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> top </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> right </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bottom </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                    width </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> height </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;auto&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>                    conditionalPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;input.view==&#39;Lives&#39;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                     DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;matrix&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                     hr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                                     DT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ppv&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>And here&#39;s the css supporting both:</div><div><br></div><div><div><br></div><div></div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#800\">#controls {</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">/* Appearance */</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  background</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">color</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> white</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  padding</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20px</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20px</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20px</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  cursor</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> move</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">/* Fade out while not hovering */</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.65</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  zoom</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  transition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> opacity </span><span style=\"color:#066\">500ms</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1s</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">#controls:hover {</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">/* Fade in while hovering */</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  opacity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.95</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  transition</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">delay</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
